A then chain, and the nested calls it is rewritten into:
  fox brown quick the
  fox brown quick the
A chain as lines, '42' then int then n * n + 1: 1765
Membership, rewritten to a call: e in vowels is true, e not in vowels is false
One function, compiled once per kind of list it is called with:
  the largest of 3, 41, 7 is 41
  the largest of pear, apple, zucchini, fig is zucchini
A group of functions, each applied to 7:
  double 7 is 14
  square 7 is 49
  negate 7 is -7
The kind of a value, asked as the program runs:
  3 is int, 2.5 is float, a is str, true is bool
  [1, 2] is array, map[a = 1] is map, Point[1, 2] is Point, double is fn
